complete -c netop -n '__fish_seen_subcommand_from traffic' -a stack -d 'Write the VictoriaMetrics scrape config, vmalert rules, dashboards for the selected grapher, systemd user units, and a compose file. Dashboards are provisioned from these files rather than edited in a browser. graphers lists which are available. --role collector generates the collector alone -- no exposition, no storage, no dashboards -- which is what a remote poller needs: the machine that pulls from it keeps and draws the readings, and anything published on the poller would be a new listener on the network it was placed there to observe.'
